    "directions": [
      "In a large bowl, add grated potato, sweet corn kernels.",
      "Add bread crumbs, poha powder, green chillies,black pepper powder.",
      "Add dried oregano, ginger, salt to taste, processed cheese and mix everything well.",
      "Now, make a small bite size portion and give it any shape you desire.",
      "Now make slurry in a bowl with refined flour, salt and water, mix it properly and the consistency should be medium thick (a thin coating).",
      "Now dip the shaped nuggets in the slurry and then in a fresh bread crumb and coat it properly from all sides.",
      "Heat oil in a kadai, dip one by one nuggets into the oil.",
      "Fry from all the sides until golden brown in color and crisp."
    ],
